Had the same problem when I first tried.  If you pay close
attention to what Norn tells you, you can figure it out provided
you know the terms appended to your name as your experience
increases.  Norn tells you what you need to be.  For a Valk,
the only character I've made it that far with, Norn says you
need to be Warrior which occurs when you reach about level 14
(experience).  I think for a Valkierye, it was a poor choice
since if you don't know the terms for the different levels of
experience, you'll think he's just telling to you to come back
when you're more experienced (which he is anyway), instead of
returning when you reach a specific level in the game.

Depending on your character, you may also need certain
intrinsics.  I think fire resistance is necessary for Valks.

